 Graph Delete  (cost=0.03..85.00 rows=1200 width=0)
   ->  Nested Loop CypherDelete Join  (cost=0.03..85.00 rows=1200 width=64)
         ->  Seq Scan on n5 n  (cost=0.00..22.00 rows=1200 width=32)
         ->  Aggregate  (cost=0.03..0.04 rows=1 width=32)
               ->  Nested Loop  (cost=0.00..0.03 rows=1 width=30)
                     Join Filter: ((e_1.start = v.id) OR (e_1."end" = v.id))
                     ->  Seq Scan on ag_edge e_1  (cost=0.00..0.00 rows=1 width=30)
                     ->  Function Scan on unnest v  (cost=0.00..0.01 rows=1 width=8)
(8 rows)

